###############################################################################
# AOC — Harmonized Single Snakefile
# - Preprocess codon MSAs
# - GARD recombination + partitioning (multiple-of-3 enforced)
# - Selection analyses on ALL partitions (FEL/MEME/ABSREL/BUSTED, optional RELAX/CFEL)
# - Summarization layer (executive summary + plots) that consumes partition JSONs directly
#
# Notes:
# - No repeated imports
# - No conda directives
# - Logging added to every rule (log wildcards match output wildcards)
###############################################################################

